# Basemap drop directory (handoff 0027). Holds region.pmtiles — the
# OpenStreetMap-derived street map for this installation's own service
# area, downloaded once (with consent, stated first) by:
#
#     ./install/install.sh --download-basemap
#
# Runtime data, never source (same posture as ../tides-drop): the archive
# is generated per-installation from the agency's own stop coordinates, so
# nothing in here is committed. This .gitignore is tracked so the directory
# always exists in a checkout — the web container bind-mounts it read-only
# even before any basemap has been downloaded.
#
# Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), via the Protomaps daily
# planet build. The map UI displays that credit whenever tiles render.
*
!.gitignore
